<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#090909">
  <meta name="description" content="Aberration turns streaming sensor data into evidence of change. Continuous anomaly detection for connected systems.">
  <title>Aberration — Evidence of change.</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://{{ ingress_base_domain | e }}/">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='12' fill='%23090909'/%3E%3Cpath d='M37 12h9L27 52h-9Z' fill='%23f2f2f2'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --paper: #f2f2f2;
      --muted: #a3a3a3;
      --line: #333;
      font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
      background: #090909;
      color: var(--paper);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; }
    a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: .3em; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--paper); outline-offset: 6px; }
    ::selection { background: var(--paper); color: #090909; }
    .page { max-width: 1440px; padding: 0 5vw; margin: auto; }
    .skip-link { position: absolute; left: 5vw; top: -5rem; padding: 1rem; background: #090909; }
    .skip-link:focus { top: 1rem; z-index: 1; }
    header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; min-height: 108px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .wordmark { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .85rem; font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
    .mark { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -.16em; margin-right: .2rem; }
    .nav-link { font-size: .875rem; text-decoration: none; padding: .75rem 0; }
    .nav-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .arrow { display: inline-block; margin-left: .8em; }
    .hero { padding: 5.5rem 0 4.5rem; }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 2.6rem; font-size: .8125rem; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center; }
    h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3.1rem, 6.1vw, 5.5rem); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -.075em; line-height: 1.04; }
    h1 span { display: block; }
    .description { max-width: 37rem; margin: 2rem 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; }
    .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2.5rem; min-height: 52px; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--paper); background: var(--paper); color: #090909; text-decoration: none; font-size: .875rem; }
    .button:hover { background: #090909; color: var(--paper); }
    figure { margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
    .figure-label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--muted); }
    .signal { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; overflow: visible; }
    .signal .grid { stroke: #272727; stroke-width: 1; }
    .signal .baseline { stroke: #666; stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 5; }
    .signal .trace { stroke: var(--paper); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; stroke-linejoin: round; }
    .signal .change { stroke: #999; stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 2 5; }
    figcaption { padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: .8125rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .principle { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 5rem; padding-top: 1.3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: .8125rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .principle span:last-child { color: var(--muted); }
    .method { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .method article { padding: 2rem 2.5rem 2.2rem 0; }
    .method article + article { padding-left: 2.5rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .number { color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; }
    h2 { margin: 1.6rem 0 .9rem; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: normal; }
    .method p { margin: 0; max-width: 25rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.8; }
    footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; padding: 2rem 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    footer p { margin: 0; }
    @media (min-width: 1600px) { .page { padding: 0 72px; } }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero-grid { gap: 2rem; }
      .hero { padding-top: 4rem; }
      .method article { padding-right: 1.5rem; }
      .method article + article { padding-left: 1.5rem; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .page { padding: 0 6vw; }
      header { min-height: 88px; gap: 1rem; }
      .wordmark { font-size: 1.1rem; gap: .6rem; }
      .nav-link { font-size: .8125rem; }
      .nav-link .arrow { margin-left: .2rem; }
      .hero { padding: 3.5rem 0 2.5rem; }
      .eyebrow { font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .06em; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3.5rem; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 11.5vw, 4.5rem); }
      .description { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
      figure { max-width: 30rem; }
      .principle { margin-top: 2.5rem; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; }
      .method { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .method article, .method article + article { padding: 1.75rem 0; border-left: 0; }
      .method article + article { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      h2 { margin-top: .9rem; }
      .method p { font-size: 1rem; max-width: none; }
      footer { flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <div class="wordmark"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">[ / ]</span>aberration</div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a class="nav-link" href="{{ frontend_base_url | e }}/">Dashboard<span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="headline">
        <p class="eyebrow">Streaming data. Statistical evidence.</p>
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div>
            <h1 id="headline"><span>Evidence</span><span>of change.</span></h1>
            <p class="description">Every system has a rhythm. Aberration monitors the relationships in your sensor data and surfaces the moments that depart from it.</p>
            <a class="button" href="{{ frontend_base_url | e }}/">Open dashboard<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
          <figure>
            <div class="figure-label"><span>FIG. 01 / DEVIATION</span><span>TIME →</span></div>
            <svg class="signal" viewBox="0 0 440 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="signal-title signal-description">
              <title id="signal-title">A signal departing from its baseline</title>
              <desc id="signal-description">An illustrative trace begins with small oscillations, then shifts into a larger, sustained deviation. This is a conceptual illustration, not live telemetry.</desc>
              <g class="grid">
                <path d="M0 30H440M0 90H440M0 150H440M0 210H440M0 270H440"/>
                <path d="M20 0V300M100 0V300M180 0V300M260 0V300M340 0V300M420 0V300"/>
              </g>
              <path class="baseline" d="M0 150H440"/>
              <path class="change" d="M260 0V300"/>
              <path class="trace" d="M0 151 8 151 16 148 24 155 32 146 40 152 48 150 56 155 64 143 72 156 80 150 88 148 96 154 104 145 112 151 120 153 128 147 136 154 144 145 152 150 160 157 168 147 176 152 184 143 192 151 200 155 208 148 216 152 224 145 232 155 240 149 248 152 256 145 264 136 272 147 280 119 288 132 296 104 304 116 312 80 320 95 328 57 336 76 344 43 352 59 360 34 368 50 376 30 384 47 392 26 400 44 408 33 416 50 424 28 432 41 440 30"/>
              <circle cx="260" cy="140" r="4" fill="#f2f2f2"/>
            </svg>
            <figcaption>Small departures. Accumulating evidence.<br>A different view of what your systems are telling you.</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <div class="principle"><span>Continuous anomaly detection for connected systems.</span><span>Observe / Calibrate / Detect</span></div>
      </section>
      <section class="method" aria-label="From observations to evidence">
        <article>
          <span class="number">01 / OBSERVE</span>
          <h2>Read the relationships.</h2>
          <p>Bring sensor streams into view. Monitor how measurements behave together, beyond individual readings.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="number">02 / CALIBRATE</span>
          <h2>Establish the reference.</h2>
          <p>Learn from baseline data and calibrate anomaly scores with conformal methods.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="number">03 / DETECT</span>
          <h2>Follow the evidence.</h2>
          <p>Accumulate evidence as observations arrive. Inspect detected changes alongside the underlying telemetry.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <p>ABERRATION / Anomaly detection</p>
      <p>Built around evidence.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
